WEBVTT

00:08.200 --> 00:14.990
-The Mourner's Eyes-

01:32.150 --> 01:36.490
Episode 4

01:41.520 --> 01:43.870
Hey, you forgot something!

01:43.870 --> 01:45.500
A courier will pick it up at 7:00 PM.

01:45.500 --> 01:46.820
Just give it to him.

01:46.820 --> 01:48.540
If he doesn't pick it up,

01:48.540 --> 01:49.870
you know the consequences.

02:00.260 --> 02:03.060
There are still three hours until 7:00 PM.

02:03.060 --> 02:04.920
In three hours,

02:05.650 --> 02:08.350
I can wash my hands of this.

02:17.070 --> 02:19.280
It's like the sky fell.

02:19.280 --> 02:21.880
The damage is too severe.

02:21.880 --> 02:23.840
The collapse pattern doesn't make sense.

02:23.840 --> 02:27.040
If it were a normal earthquake,
the destruction wouldn't be so concentrated.

02:27.040 --> 02:28.300
What about the casualties?

02:28.300 --> 02:30.880
There weren't many people since the station just started operating.

02:32.450 --> 02:33.710
How lucky...

02:35.690 --> 02:36.630
Bloodstains...

02:36.630 --> 02:39.440
Raymond might have been
standing here at the time.

02:40.180 --> 02:44.010
Brother, what can you tell from all
this broken glass on the ground?

02:44.010 --> 02:47.680
We can't see anything,
but there's someone who can.

02:49.130 --> 02:52.680
There's an ability to imagine the situation
at the time through observation.

02:52.680 --> 02:54.230
Who are you video calling, Brother?

02:54.650 --> 02:55.900
Someone you know.

02:57.640 --> 02:59.350
Can you see my surroundings clearly?

02:59.350 --> 03:00.490
Very clearly.

03:00.920 --> 03:03.530
Norma's already filled me in,
so I understand everything.

03:04.140 --> 03:07.450
Right now I need you to walk along
Raymond's route at the time,

03:07.450 --> 03:09.750
and I'll try to recreate the situation.

03:09.750 --> 03:10.640
Nono?

03:11.090 --> 03:14.080
Should... I say hello to her?

03:14.080 --> 03:15.250
Who's on your left?

03:15.250 --> 03:17.860
Huh? I'm not on screen.

03:17.860 --> 03:19.420
How did she know someone's there?

03:19.420 --> 03:22.150
It's Lu Mingfei. He's the
specialist of this mission.

03:22.150 --> 03:23.050
I'm supporting him.

03:23.050 --> 03:26.180
Tell him to move aside,
he'll interfere with my judgment.

03:27.490 --> 03:28.540
Move aside.

03:28.850 --> 03:29.890
Okay.

03:30.430 --> 03:33.920
She didn't even bother
to wish me a happy birthday.

03:33.920 --> 03:34.980
Let's begin.

03:34.980 --> 03:37.560
Right now, you are Raymond,
carrying important documents.

03:37.560 --> 03:39.860
He's just walked into
the south train station.

03:39.860 --> 03:43.170
He's unfamiliar with the place,
so he'll definitely stop to look at signs.

03:44.970 --> 03:47.370
Keep going forward.
The departure floor is upstairs.

03:52.370 --> 03:53.420
Stop there.

03:53.420 --> 03:55.380
Look down. There should be footprints.

03:55.790 --> 03:56.970
There are lots.

03:56.970 --> 03:59.880
Yes, there should be a leak above.

04:00.340 --> 04:03.120
From the different footprints and
spacing left behind Raymond,

04:03.120 --> 04:05.930
you can tell that he's already
been targeted by this time.

04:05.930 --> 04:07.890
Raymond will continue to move forward,

04:07.890 --> 04:10.060
then stop and turn his head.

04:10.630 --> 04:12.680
He will take in his surroundings.

04:12.680 --> 04:15.980
It's his habit and in line with
the College's investigation process.

04:16.520 --> 04:19.530
Nothing aroused Raymond's
suspicion at this point,

04:19.530 --> 04:22.490
and he continued to move forward
15 meters to the ticket gate.

04:22.490 --> 04:23.780
Just stop there for a bit.

04:24.530 --> 04:25.780
Take another look around.

04:29.760 --> 04:32.680
He didn't see anything unusual and
prepared to enter the station.

04:33.040 --> 04:35.710
After that, the collapse began.

04:37.740 --> 04:40.570
Earthquake! No!

04:40.570 --> 04:42.760
Run! Earthquake!

04:45.090 --> 04:47.470
The place where he died was
very close to the bench.

04:47.880 --> 04:51.340
With his training, he would
have hidden under the bench.

04:51.340 --> 04:52.700
But he didn't,

04:52.700 --> 04:56.190
which means that he encountered danger
in a place where he couldn't escape.

04:56.560 --> 04:58.160
The conclusion is very clear.

04:58.160 --> 05:01.610
The information was lost within
a few minutes of his death.

05:01.610 --> 05:03.070
Why within a few minutes?

05:03.070 --> 05:06.160
Someone stepped in Raymond's blood,
and the bloodstains are fuzzy.

05:06.160 --> 05:08.770
So this happened when the blood was fresh.

05:08.770 --> 05:12.750
Although the scene had lots of footprints,
only this footprint was near Raymond.

05:13.200 --> 05:14.930
Judging by the footprints,

05:14.930 --> 05:18.080
this person's steps were weak
and he's not highly trained.

05:18.460 --> 05:22.050
He must have escaped through the
nearest exit, which is to your right.

05:28.220 --> 05:30.050
The thief drove a high horsepower vehicle.

05:30.050 --> 05:32.030
Its tires softened from the heat.

05:32.030 --> 05:35.520
He was nervous and floored the accelerator,
leaving behind these tire tracks.

05:35.520 --> 05:38.020
I don't need to help you with the rest.

05:38.020 --> 05:38.900
Thanks.

05:38.900 --> 05:41.820
Oh, I have another theory
for you to think about.

05:41.820 --> 05:45.360
There was a third person present at the time.

05:46.320 --> 05:49.620
That person saw the thief steal the
information after Raymond's death,

05:49.620 --> 05:51.680
and the thief would have
seen that person, too.

05:51.680 --> 05:55.500
The thief's shoes were bloody,
and his footprints turned around,

05:55.500 --> 05:58.130
which means that he saw
something of concern,

05:58.130 --> 05:59.330
most likely a person.

05:59.740 --> 06:00.750
What kind of person?

06:00.750 --> 06:04.550
I don't know. I just put together
all the images you sent over,

06:04.550 --> 06:07.300
and felt that someone was
watching everything at that time.

06:07.300 --> 06:09.390
Understood, thanks.

06:10.640 --> 06:11.540
Bye!

06:11.980 --> 06:14.910
Brother, how's the investigation going?

06:14.910 --> 06:17.490
Almost done. I think
we can solve it tonight.

06:17.490 --> 06:19.060
That's good, that's good!

06:19.060 --> 06:20.800
I have more experience than you,

06:20.800 --> 06:22.640
so for now, I'll handle the
operational details for you.

06:22.640 --> 06:26.150
Can we meet at 19:25 at the
Runde Towers, specialist?

06:26.150 --> 06:29.610
Of course! I trust you to do the job!

06:43.290 --> 06:43.710
Chen

06:44.250 --> 06:47.350
Tell me, on that day at
the bottom of the sea,

06:47.350 --> 06:50.680
what happened between you
and Dragon King Norton?

06:50.680 --> 06:54.720
You were so badly injured.
How are you still alive?

06:56.330 --> 06:58.430
I... won't tell you.

06:58.430 --> 06:59.890
Continue.

07:07.150 --> 07:08.010
Nono...

07:08.780 --> 07:09.660
Nono...

07:09.990 --> 07:10.890
Nono...

07:11.320 --> 07:13.030
Don't die!

07:13.860 --> 07:15.540
Ricardo...

07:20.260 --> 07:21.790
Are you okay?

07:23.790 --> 07:24.810
I'm fine.

07:25.290 --> 07:28.920
Sorry, I was just messing around with you.

07:29.280 --> 07:31.880
I don't feel well. I'm going to the sauna.

07:31.880 --> 07:36.060
By the way, did you remember that
today is Lu Mingfei's birthday?

07:36.060 --> 07:37.390
Did you message him?

07:37.390 --> 07:39.210
I remember.

07:42.950 --> 07:47.360
It feels like Nono has become
a different person lately.

07:52.360 --> 07:56.660
The tire tracks found by
Chu Zihang were left by a large SUV.

07:56.660 --> 07:59.580
and this is the most suspicious
name on the list of owners.

07:59.960 --> 08:02.250
The Millennium Labor Export Company.

08:02.250 --> 08:04.500
The company's registered
address is the Runde Towers.

08:04.500 --> 08:07.010
The Millennium Labor Export Company?

08:07.010 --> 08:10.190
I know that name. It's the
Hunter Organization's company.

08:10.190 --> 08:13.840
Correct, and it's headed
by a guy named Tang Wei.

08:13.840 --> 08:18.550
The Hunters are a loose organization
hired to help people solve problems.

08:18.550 --> 08:23.520
It's a complex organization made up
of desperate outlaws and rogues.

08:23.520 --> 08:28.390
The jobs they accept are in the
grey area between legal and illegal.

08:28.390 --> 08:30.990
They generally do not
murder or commit arson,

08:30.990 --> 08:34.450
but they steal, dig graves
and loot artifacts.

08:34.450 --> 08:39.530
In any case, a major part of their
work is related to the Dragon Raja,

08:39.530 --> 08:43.000
and they have a small number of
hybrids among their members.

08:43.160 --> 08:48.040
Those outlaws who broke into the College on
motorcycles earlier were from that organization.

08:48.210 --> 08:51.510
Yes, Norton, the King of Bronze and Fire,

08:51.590 --> 08:55.840
was a professional hunter working in New York
before he awakened as a Dragon King.

08:55.840 --> 08:58.350
Back then, he was just a punk.

08:58.430 --> 09:02.270
So far, the College has avoided
direct contact with the Hunters.

09:02.270 --> 09:04.450
Apart from when they broke into the College,

09:04.450 --> 09:08.520
the petty fights of the Hunters
rarely infringe on College interests.

09:08.520 --> 09:10.070
But this time is different.

09:10.070 --> 09:13.010
They actually dared to kill Raymond,
an execution bureau specialist,

09:13.010 --> 09:15.780
and took the school board's
important information!

09:16.280 --> 09:21.240
We've only got four hours before the school board
asks for the information to be returned.

09:21.240 --> 09:22.870
We don't have time to waste.

09:22.870 --> 09:24.340
Let's take direct action.

09:24.340 --> 09:26.660
The school board has already made a move.

09:26.660 --> 09:27.620
Oh?

09:27.620 --> 09:30.270
They seem to be suspicious of Chu Zihang.

09:30.270 --> 09:32.850
Besides appointing Lu Mingfei
as the mission specialist,

09:32.850 --> 09:36.560
they also sent the people on this
list to assist in the mission.

09:37.920 --> 09:40.180
Why would they send these people out?

09:42.440 --> 09:46.620
These politicians who only know how to
give orders simply don't understand

09:46.620 --> 09:49.060
that they can't help Chu Zihang.

09:49.060 --> 09:51.850
He is unable to work with others.

09:51.850 --> 09:55.710
Every mission he's ever been on
was actually completed by him alone.

09:56.640 --> 09:59.180
Hurry up! The elevator doors are closing!

10:00.530 --> 10:03.280
I'm so tired. What's for dinner tonight?

10:03.280 --> 10:06.000
I asked Lu Mingfei to cut
carrots, steam sausages,

10:06.000 --> 10:07.990
chop some spring onions,
and soak the rice noodles.

10:07.990 --> 10:10.460
Doesn't Mingze like to eat
crossing-the-bridge noodles?

10:10.460 --> 10:13.220
Tonight, we'll have rib stew with
carrots, rice noodles with rib soup,

10:13.220 --> 10:14.560
and Guangdong sausages.

10:14.560 --> 10:18.380
I also bought salmon, so I'll prepare
some sashimi for my favorite son.

10:19.560 --> 10:20.930
Sounds good, Mom.

10:25.350 --> 10:26.590
How unrefined.

10:27.140 --> 10:29.060
Why are you back so late?

10:29.620 --> 10:30.400
Aunt!

10:30.400 --> 10:31.740
Where have you been?

10:31.740 --> 10:34.580
I told you to steam sausages,
chop onions, cut carrots,

10:34.580 --> 10:36.940
and buy a toilet seat.
Have you done all that?

10:36.940 --> 10:39.410
It's finished... Finished. All finished.

10:40.000 --> 10:41.550
I need to have faith.

10:41.550 --> 10:42.640
I trust Chu Zihang.

10:42.730 --> 10:43.890
I trust Chu Zihang.

10:44.450 --> 10:46.260
Hanging out all day...

10:46.260 --> 10:49.220
Don't you know there's a family dinner tonight to celebrate Lu Mingze studying abroad?

10:49.220 --> 10:52.580
Preparing dinner for him is the
most important thing today!

10:53.310 --> 10:55.430
I will check your work carefully later.

10:55.430 --> 10:57.460
If you've made a mistake, I will punish you!

10:57.850 --> 10:59.840
Yes... Yes...

10:59.840 --> 11:01.130
I trust Chu Zihang.

11:01.230 --> 11:02.590
I trust Chu Zihang.

11:03.240 --> 11:05.630
Where did you put the chopped
carrots and spring onions?

11:05.630 --> 11:06.890
I need them right now—

11:07.380 --> 11:08.360
Huh?

11:12.770 --> 11:18.240
Robbery! Take the money in the
desk drawer! Don't hurt us!

11:13.690 --> 11:15.160
Thieves!

11:15.160 --> 11:18.240
Help! Help!

11:18.240 --> 11:19.990
Greetings, specialist Lu!

11:23.260 --> 11:26.310
You guys are... from
the College's labor department.

11:26.310 --> 11:27.870
Hello, guys.

11:27.870 --> 11:31.340
We have completed all the missions
assigned by your deputy Chu Zihang.

11:31.340 --> 11:32.500
Please inspect.

11:33.230 --> 11:35.060
Good. Thanks for your hard work.

11:38.450 --> 11:40.380
Although the mission was to
replace the toilet seat,

11:40.380 --> 11:42.550
we realized that your toilet was too old,

11:42.550 --> 11:45.680
so we took the initiative to replace
it with the latest AI toilet model,

11:45.680 --> 11:47.520
which has 4,000 modes built in.

11:47.520 --> 11:50.730
In addition, we also replaced all the
plumbing in the building for this.

11:50.730 --> 11:53.590
Of course, if you still
like the original toilet,

11:53.590 --> 11:55.190
we can also restore it immediately.

11:55.190 --> 11:58.330
Uh... no. This is good.

11:58.330 --> 12:00.470
What's the point of an AI toilet?

12:00.470 --> 12:02.240
I-I don't know.

12:02.240 --> 12:04.700
Please go to the living room
to see the steamed sausages.

12:04.700 --> 12:06.320
The mission was to steam sausages,

12:06.320 --> 12:08.190
but we didn't know your taste,

12:08.190 --> 12:09.790
so we prepared three flavors:

12:09.790 --> 12:12.140
spicy, five-spice and Cantonese.

12:12.140 --> 12:13.570
How thoughtful.

12:13.570 --> 12:15.040
They're all delicious.

12:15.040 --> 12:18.170
Next, the shredded carrots
and chopped spring onion.

12:18.170 --> 12:19.180
They're all here.

12:19.180 --> 12:22.050
Did you guys have to chop all the carrots?

12:22.050 --> 12:25.930
Are you... making hot sauce with
so much chopped spring onion?

12:25.930 --> 12:28.000
The mission didn't require
us to make hot sauce.

12:28.000 --> 12:30.140
To be honest, cooking is not our strong suit.

12:30.140 --> 12:31.980
That concludes our mission report.

12:31.980 --> 12:34.060
Do you have any other
requests, specialist Lu?

12:34.060 --> 12:37.560
Uh... no. We've already troubled you enough.

12:37.560 --> 12:38.960
Then we will take our leave.

12:38.960 --> 12:40.960
There is a dedicated driver
waiting for you downstairs.

12:40.960 --> 12:42.900
He will take you to the
location of the next mission.

12:42.900 --> 12:45.320
Okay. I'll change and go downstairs.

12:45.320 --> 12:46.300
Goodbye.

12:47.220 --> 12:48.200
Bye.

12:54.400 --> 12:55.840
Lu Mingfei.

12:55.840 --> 12:56.880
Y-Yes?

12:56.880 --> 12:59.540
Asking these mysterious
people to do housework...

12:59.540 --> 13:01.250
Are you showing off to me?

13:01.250 --> 13:02.500
O-Of course not—

13:02.500 --> 13:04.770
You asked the special forces to chop carrots?

13:04.770 --> 13:06.220
If that isn't showing off, what is it?

13:06.220 --> 13:09.400
Today's the family dinner to celebrate
Lu Mingze studying abroad,

13:09.400 --> 13:11.580
so you deliberately made such a scene!

13:11.580 --> 13:12.960
You want to embarrass him, right?

13:12.960 --> 13:13.920
How would I?

13:14.640 --> 13:18.250
You just look down on Mingze!

13:14.640 --> 13:19.540
I understand. So my aunt and
I don't live in the same world at all!

13:18.250 --> 13:20.360
You just can't stand me ordering you around!

13:19.540 --> 13:23.530
In my aunt's world, I am ruthless and dark,

13:20.360 --> 13:24.310
You're great, you've got a bunch of people
to stir up trouble, you're ruthless!

13:23.530 --> 13:27.180
look down on Lu Mingze,
and have Anguo's education.

13:24.310 --> 13:28.530
Your family has been stepping
on me all my life! Bullying me!

13:27.180 --> 13:31.910
I was cowardly before, so I should continue
to be cowardly and keep my head down.

13:28.530 --> 13:30.560
I'm not as educated and
well-mannered as your mother.

13:30.560 --> 13:34.870
Mingze is not as stylish and presentable
as you, without Anguo's education.

13:31.910 --> 13:34.870
I should live my life
by keeping my head down

13:34.870 --> 13:37.200
and quietly getting by.

13:37.200 --> 13:40.340
I... I raised you for nothing.

13:40.340 --> 13:41.400
That's...

13:42.420 --> 13:44.140
Lu Mingze's...

13:46.060 --> 13:48.020
Today is also my birthday.

13:51.020 --> 13:52.400
I've never eaten...

13:53.950 --> 13:57.300
a piece of birthday cake
that belongs to me in my life.

13:59.070 --> 14:01.440
A table for two has been
reserved at Aspasia tonight,

14:01.440 --> 14:04.440
and your dinner with Miss Chen
Wenwen will start at 6:30 PM.

14:04.440 --> 14:06.850
Huh? Isn't there a mission tonight?

14:06.850 --> 14:08.860
What dinner? I don't know.

14:08.860 --> 14:10.790
In accordance with the plan
of your deputy Chu Zihang,

14:10.790 --> 14:13.780
you will have dinner with
Miss Chen Wenwen at the Aspasia first.

14:13.780 --> 14:15.870
You have 40 minutes to eat,

14:15.870 --> 14:18.750
and at 19:00, I will take you to
the Runde Towers for your mission.

14:18.750 --> 14:22.200
But Brother didn't tell me in advance.

14:22.200 --> 14:23.640
Chen Wenwen.

14:24.850 --> 14:26.370
Today is my birthday,

14:27.030 --> 14:29.280
so Brother specially made
a reservation for me.

14:32.310 --> 14:36.390
I think I understand why I always
act cowardly in front of my aunt.

14:36.390 --> 14:40.940
It's because this simple three-bedroom
flat in the community is like my home.

14:42.310 --> 14:44.670
I am different from other
people at Cassel College.

14:44.670 --> 14:46.140
I don't want to be lonely.

14:46.140 --> 14:49.200
I just want to have a home to
go back to like normal people.

14:49.200 --> 14:51.320
But Cassel College is another path in life.

14:51.320 --> 14:53.540
Once you start down this fork in the path,

14:53.540 --> 14:55.330
the door to your past life is closed,

14:55.330 --> 14:59.620
and you can only move forward,
never to return to the human world.

15:01.040 --> 15:04.920
The Runde Towers are twin buildings,
divided into tower A and tower B.

15:04.920 --> 15:08.970
The core objective is to break into the
21st floor of tower A of the Runde Towers,

15:08.970 --> 15:10.600
where the information should be located.

15:10.600 --> 15:13.350
The security of the Runde Towers
is actually very tight.

15:13.350 --> 15:16.630
The developer has contracted the
building's security to the Hunters,

15:16.630 --> 15:18.930
so the whole building
is full of their people.

15:18.930 --> 15:22.690
If the operation exceeds ten
minutes, the police will arrive,

15:22.690 --> 15:25.270
and the Hunters will have time
to move the information.

15:25.270 --> 15:28.180
So little time? The elevator
hasn't even arrived yet.

15:28.180 --> 15:29.530
We won't take the elevator.

15:29.530 --> 15:32.860
We'll take the direct route.

15:39.620 --> 15:41.340
Have you read the action plan?

15:41.340 --> 15:43.820
This mission is very easy.
I can handle it by myself.

15:43.820 --> 15:45.560
I don't need the labor department's help.

15:45.560 --> 15:46.530
They're too flashy.

15:46.530 --> 15:47.590
Obey the order.

15:48.150 --> 15:51.710
They will meet you at the door
of tower B in five minutes.

15:51.710 --> 15:52.260
Yes, sir.

15:56.190 --> 15:58.690
Why... Why isn't he here yet?

16:00.310 --> 16:02.870
Hello? Is there a courier
on the way to tower A?

16:02.870 --> 16:03.600
No.

16:04.150 --> 16:05.470
Is the mall in tower B closed?

16:05.470 --> 16:08.100
Yes, in accordance with your
instructions, it's closed today.

16:08.100 --> 16:09.730
Now we're the only ones in the building.

16:09.730 --> 16:10.320
Good.

16:14.030 --> 16:16.700
Ah... This weather is really uncomfortable.

16:17.740 --> 16:19.880
Let's take one last look
at the Hunter website.

16:22.000 --> 16:23.100
Mail?

16:24.750 --> 16:25.850
"Bye-bye"?

16:27.580 --> 16:29.300
The meaning of "bye-bye"...

16:30.660 --> 16:33.260
can also be "farewell"?

16:47.810 --> 16:48.700
Thanks.

16:50.270 --> 16:52.990
I'm going... to such a high-end restaurant?

16:56.210 --> 16:59.120
Greetings, Mr. Ricardo M. Lu.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.160
Hello.

17:00.160 --> 17:02.310
The Aspasia is reserved tonight.

17:02.310 --> 17:04.290
You are our only VIP.

17:05.740 --> 17:07.500
Thank you for your help.

17:07.500 --> 17:09.880
Your guest is already seated
on the second floor.

17:53.920 --> 17:55.050
Lu Mingfei.

17:56.390 --> 17:57.180
Hello.

18:12.860 --> 18:15.540
Chu Zihang, all personnel are in position.

18:16.320 --> 18:17.740
When will the mission begin?

18:18.280 --> 18:20.120
You have three minutes to prepare.

18:20.120 --> 18:22.780
Professor Webber will send orders
directly to your headset.

18:22.780 --> 18:25.250
Park the van farther away,
so it does not attract attention.

18:25.510 --> 18:26.540
Understood.

18:26.540 --> 18:28.620
I'll go in first.

18:32.140 --> 18:33.460
The mall is closed today.

18:33.460 --> 18:34.300
I'm a courier.

18:34.300 --> 18:35.600
Flower delivery.

18:35.600 --> 18:36.880
Tower B, suite 906.

18:37.300 --> 18:39.540
Boss, flower delivery for
tower B, suite 906.

18:39.540 --> 18:40.510
Do we let him in?

18:40.510 --> 18:42.030
906?

18:43.280 --> 18:44.720
They open tomorrow.

18:44.720 --> 18:46.770
He's also a big client of ours.

18:47.470 --> 18:48.610
Just one person?

18:48.610 --> 18:49.260
Yes.

18:49.260 --> 18:50.370
Keep an eye on him!

18:50.370 --> 18:52.400
No one can enter tower A!

18:52.400 --> 18:53.110
Understood.

18:54.730 --> 18:56.400
He's not coming.

18:58.440 --> 19:00.200
I'm already in tower B.

19:00.200 --> 19:01.030
Very good.

19:01.030 --> 19:04.490
The five-man team will help you attract all
the security in tower B to the ground floor.

19:04.490 --> 19:06.700
You can go directly into tower A
through the connecting bridge.

19:06.700 --> 19:07.450
Okay.

19:07.450 --> 19:09.000
Start the mission!

19:12.530 --> 19:15.130
How have you been?

19:16.480 --> 19:17.520
Very good.

19:18.100 --> 19:20.340
Is it hard for you to be alone abroad?

19:21.350 --> 19:22.720
It's all right.

19:23.520 --> 19:24.490
Sorry.

19:25.220 --> 19:29.230
Start the mission

19:29.230 --> 19:32.600
Can we meet at 19:25 at the
Runde Towers, specialist?

19:33.750 --> 19:35.770
Didn't we agree that the
mission would be at 7:25 PM?

19:37.670 --> 19:39.570
But the dinner...

19:39.570 --> 19:41.740
Lu Mingfei, what's the matter?

19:41.740 --> 19:44.990
Sorry, something important
came up and I have to leave.

19:42.690 --> 19:44.160
Huh? Lu Mingfei?

19:44.990 --> 19:46.660
The bill's been paid. I'm off!

19:53.860 --> 19:54.750
Brother...

19:56.130 --> 19:58.920
Brother, I'm coming, right now!

19:59.710 --> 20:01.640
I'm telling you...

20:01.640 --> 20:02.590
Huh?

20:08.780 --> 20:09.640
Useless.

20:15.050 --> 20:16.980
Boss, there's an intruder in tower B.

20:16.980 --> 20:20.530
Deal with him immediately.
Stop him from entering tower A at all costs!

20:20.530 --> 20:24.910
Yes, sir! All security personnel,
get to the first floor immediately! Now!

20:43.220 --> 20:45.720
Sorry, can't let you guys go down there.

20:57.900 --> 21:00.460
He's in front! Catch him!

21:08.330 --> 21:09.450
Road closed!

21:09.450 --> 21:11.790
Who are these people?
Where did they come from?

21:11.790 --> 21:13.410
Boss, what now?

21:13.410 --> 21:15.750
We've already lost too many people.

21:34.310 --> 21:35.810
Report your positions.

21:35.810 --> 21:37.810
Passing over the connecting
bridge. No obstacles.

21:37.810 --> 21:39.780
The security in tower A have
not left their positions.

21:39.780 --> 21:41.460
Deal with them as fast as you can.

21:41.460 --> 21:43.440
You have seven minutes to
retrieve the information.

21:43.950 --> 21:45.030
Understood.

22:03.630 --> 22:04.960
I've entered tower A successfully.

22:04.960 --> 22:06.570
Go to the 21st floor immediately.

22:06.570 --> 22:07.880
The information is there.
